      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "1. Since it is stated at the bar by the learned counsel for the petitioners that the lis involved in the instant writ petition is squarely covered by a decision made in \"Indore Development Authority v/s Manoharlal and Ors.\", reported in (2020)8 SCC 129.",
